  "legacy_defects": [
    "the reply-events GET and DELETE answer a raw 500 'LedgerError: …' for an unknown org or node (docket reply-events-get-and-delete-answer-a-raw-500-for)"
  ],
  "scope": "Legacy boundary of the mail, inbox and file entry points (P01 F4; the external-chat routes were retired) on disposable SQLite. Drives, sparks, notices, broadcasts and the hub kick are spies; the routes, the ledger, the org inbox, file-deliveries.db, the compose stage and the scratch folders are real. Legacy conformance evidence only: not a runtime census, not PostgreSQL or Rust qualification."
}
